# This public repo publishes only the rendered profile:
#   README.md, assets/ (light + dark SVGs) and this file.
# Everything else stays on this machine. It is ignored by default, so a new
# local file can never be pushed by accident. Kept locally:
#   PROJECT_CONTEXT.md   local project notes and status (read this first)
#   profile.yml          content source (edit this, then rebuild)
#   scripts/ templates/  the generator and its checks
#   fonts/               Space Grotesk + JetBrains Mono (only needed to build)
#   requirements.txt     Python dependencies for the build
#   .github/             the optional monthly rebuild workflow (unused while the build is local)
#   _reference/          the original design kit, kept for future changes
#   preview.html         local review page
#   .venv/, editor and assistant config  local tooling
/*
!/README.md
!/assets/
!/.gitignore

# Never publish OS or editor clutter, even inside assets/.
.DS_Store
*.swp
